@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title FindCare in the target state — tools declare their routes in source, the registry is the map, the UniversalNavigator reads it

component "React shell\nwidgets import from the feature\ndirectory that owns them.\nNothing under Code/." as SHELL

component "Gate\none generic module, every container.\nCollects session token, HTTP head,\nPOST/GET params (each if present)\nand hands them to the navigator.\nKnows only transport." as GATE

component "UniversalNavigator  (SharedServices)\nreads the live registry and drives the route.\nrender ledger, deterministic merge, sessions,\nexternal calls. The only node that accepts\nexternal traffic. Holds no data." as NAV

database "Tool registry  (ChatHealthyToolRegistrySchema)\none document per build per env — instance{build,commit,env,live}\npresence = the allowlist\nsubscriptions = the dispatch table\nmay_call = the non-circular call map\nprompt fragments = the routing table\npages carry members / required_members / completeness\ngenerated from source at build" as REG #eef6f5

component "UtteranceManager  (a tool)\npreamble + every fragment in, routes out.\nDecides whether the utterance is sufficient to\ndispatch to >=1 tool, and dispatches if so.\nReturns the dispatch set; non-blocking.\nKnows no parameters.\n----\nRequestUsersRefinement  (capability, not a sibling tool):\nthe single conversational surface — no tool talks to the\nuser directly. Authors the user-facing sentence from the\nfacts. Two forms:\nRequestUsersRefinement() — the UM's own LLM authors the\nquestion when classification finds no dispatchable route\nor a missing slot;\nRequestUsersRefinement(question) — a dispatched tool\nauthored the question and the UM delivers it." as UM

component "UniversalNavigatorProxy  (FindCare satellite)\nrelays tool-to-tool in both directions.\nNo sessions, no ledger, no merge,\nno external calls. Refuses stale metadata." as PROXY

component "Individual providers  (page: individualProvider)\nprovider_search\nprovider_specialty  (vocabulary — Prescribers/Homeopathic)\ngeo  (new tool — free-text geography incl. misspellings,\nruns parallel to the vocabulary filter)\nprovider_detail\nprovider_selection" as PROVTOOLS #f5fbfa

component "Facilities  (page: facility — newly added)\nfacility_search      (revived, not re-written)\nfacility_vocabulary  (new — NUCC filter, Ambulatory /\nPsychiatric / Inpatient macro-toggles, mirrors\nthe individual Prescribers/Homeopathic filter)\ngeo  (new tool — free-text geography, parallel to the filter)\nfacility_detail      (new)\nfacility_selection" as FACTOOLS #f5fbfa

component "Clinical trials\ntrial_search\ntrial_vocabulary  (new)\ntrial_detail      (new)\ntrial_selection" as TRIALTOOLS #f5fbfa

package "FindCare/ — each tool's subscriptions and may_call live in the source the build reads" #f5fbfa {
  component "ProviderManagement\n+ service + mining + widget" as PM
  component "SpecialtyFilter\n+ filter + tool + widget" as SF
  component "ClinicalTrials\n+ service + tool + widget" as CT
  component "ProviderDetail\n+ service + record sync + widget" as PD
  component "Facility feature directory\n+ service + tools + widget\n(today these tools sit under\nsharedServices/Code, not here)" as FAC
}

component "Homeless routes\n/page/what-is-needed /page/detail-open\n/page/detail-close /welcome /health\nno tool obviously subscribes" as PAGEROUTES #fff8e6

component "Code/\nretired — nothing on disk,\nno source_location in the registry,\nno path in the build tooling" as GONE #eeeeee

SHELL --> GATE
GATE --> NAV
NAV --> REG : reads the map
NAV --> UM : classify the utterance
UM --> NAV : dispatch set
NAV --> PROXY : tool-to-tool;\nanswers return as\ninternal callbacks
PROXY --> PROVTOOLS : by subscription
PROXY --> FACTOOLS : by subscription
PROXY --> TRIALTOOLS : by subscription
PROVTOOLS --> PM
PROVTOOLS --> SF
PROVTOOLS --> PD
FACTOOLS --> FAC
TRIALTOOLS --> CT

note bottom of REG
  Five call types, all mapped, each route carrying its
  proof and timeout facts: tool_to_tool, third_party_callback
  (api_key), static_witness (none), client_sessioned
  (session_token), internal_callback (our_signature).
  The gateway itself enters the registry as a pseudo_tool.
end note

note bottom of NAV
  The navigator holds no data: the map is the registry,
  parameters ride the passed document, sessions and the
  ledger are repository rows. The hand-rolled httpx branch
  that mined geography (BUG-003) is retired in the target:
  the geo tool the navigator now dispatches is the tool that
  branch stood in for. Every throw ends here or in a proxy.
end note

note bottom of PAGEROUTES
  Drawn without a home on purpose. These five are the
  only routes with no tool that obviously subscribes,
  and picking one here would be a decision the
  requirements have not made.
end note

note bottom of GONE
  The tree is retired when the registry names none of
  it and vite.config.ts, _build_chain.py, _deploy_chain.py,
  hf_helpers.py, preflight_undefined_names.py and
  tsconfig.json all point elsewhere.
end note

note bottom of PROVTOOLS
  geo is a page-scoped member on individualProvider and
  facility only (not clinicalTrial), running parallel to the
  vocabulary/NUCC filter. It lives in the shared library today
  (BUG-003 / the geo extractor); which feature directory owns
  it in the target is unresolved — no arrow to a package is
  drawn because the requirements have not placed it.
end note

@enduml
